# P0-022 Tailscale ACL Policy — Guinevere

## Tailnet Info
- VPS: faiz-prod-01 (100.94.104.22)
- Operator: faizzzzz (100.112.201.124, fazulfi@github)
- Tailscale version: 1.98.3
- MagicDNS: tail05ac84.ts.net

## ACL Policy (HuJSON)

```jsonc
{
  // Define groups and tags
  "groups": {
    "group:admin": ["fazulfi@github"],
  },
  "tagOwners": {
    "tag:service": ["group:admin"],
  },

  // ACL grants — only these connections are allowed
  "grants": [
    // Admin group has full access to everything
    {
      "src": ["group:admin"],
      "dst": ["*:*"],
    },

    // Tagged services on VPS can reach each other
    {
      "src": ["tag:service"],
      "dst": ["tag:service:*"],
    },

    // Admin group can SSH into all machines
    {
      "src": ["group:admin"],
      "dst": ["*:22"],
    },
  ],

  // SSH grants (separate from network grants)
  "ssh": [
    {
      "action": "accept",
      "src": ["group:admin"],
      "dst": ["tag:service"],
      "users": ["root", "guinevere", "aizanta", "faiz"],
    },
  ],

  // Auto-approvers for headless devices
  "autoApprovers": {
    "routes": {
      "0.0.0.0/0": [],
      "10.0.0.0/8": ["tag:service"],
    },
  },

  // Self-test: verify admin can reach everything at policy change time
  "tests": [
    {
      "src": "fazulfi@github",
      "accept": ["tag:service:22"],
      "deny": ["tag:service:5433"],
    },
  ],
}
```

## Instructions for Faiz

1. Go to https://login.tailscale.com/admin/acls
2. Replace existing ACL with the above HuJSON
3. Check "Convert to grants" if prompted
4. Apply

## Verification Commands

```bash
tailscale status                    # VPS online at 100.94.104.22
tailscale ip -4                     # 100.94.104.22
tailscale ping faizzzzz             # <20ms direct
ping faizzzzz                       # ICMP <20ms
tailscale status --json | grep Tags # confirm tag:service after tagging
```

## Post-ACL Steps (after policy applied)

```bash
# Tag the VPS as a service
sudo tailscale set --advertise-tags=tag:service

# Enable Tailscale SSH
sudo tailscale set --ssh

# Re-verify
tailscale status --self
tailscale ping faizzzzz
```